+# Operator Checklist (concise)
+
+Quick checklist to provision, deploy and validate Option A + MCP/A2A/n8n:
+
+1) Provision KMS & Rekor (one cloud)
+   - cd terraform/aws && terraform init && terraform apply -auto-approve
+   - OR use terraform/gcp or terraform/azure per cloud
+   - Capture outputs: cosign KMS ARN and Rekor endpoint
+
+2) Wire GitHub secrets
+   - ./ops/ci/set_github_secrets_allclouds.sh <owner/repo> "<COSIGN_KEY_URI>" "<REKOR_SERVER_URL>"
+
+3) Configure GitHub OIDC federation
+   - Use scripts/create_github_oidc_*.sh for lead examples and follow ops/ci/github_oidc_federation.md
+
+4) Deploy Rekor (k8s) + Vault + ExternalSecrets + n8n
+   - helm upgrade --install rekor helm/rekor -f helm/rekor/values.yaml --namespace aegis-system
+   - helm upgrade --install vault hashicorp/vault -f ops/vault/vault-ha-values.yaml --namespace vault
+   - kubectl apply -f k8s/external-secrets/secretstore-vault.yaml
+   - kubectl apply -f k8s/external-secrets/externalsecret-cosign.yaml
+   - helm upgrade --install n8n helm/n8n -f helm/n8n/values.yaml --namespace aegis-ops
+
+5) Deploy MCP service & set MCP_API secret
+   - Build + push container for mcp/server and deploy; set MCP_API as GitHub secret
+
+6) Deploy A2A topics and approver consumer
+   - kubectl apply -f a2a/strimzi/topics.yaml
+   - Build container for a2a/consumer/approver_consumer.py and deploy in aegis-messaging
+
+7) Run validation
+   - python3 ops/validation/readiness_check.py
+   - Trigger .github/workflows/test_sign_and_rekor.yml via GitHub Actions UI
+   - Trigger .github/workflows/publish_mcp.yml to publish & sign an MCP record
+   - Run n8n example workflows to exercise TRT bake & approval (import JSONs)
+
+8) Evidence & audit
+   - Run ops/compliance/evidence_packager_enhanced.py and ops/compliance/evidence_mcp_a2a.py
+   - Store evidence bundle in secure audit S3 and reference in POA&M
+
+9) Schedule: run .github/workflows/auto_validators.yml nightly (created in repo) and monitor alerts.
+
